类型名：TextInputOptions
类型描述：TextInput文本输入框的配置参数。
参数：{'placeholder': {"type":"ResourceStr","required":false,"description":"设置无输入时的提示文本。","enum":null,"enumDescriptions":null,"default":null}, 'text': {"type":"ResourceStr","required":false,"description":"设置输入框当前的文本内容。该参数支持$$双向绑定变量。","enum":null,"enumDescriptions":null,"default":null}, 'controller': {"type":"TextInputController","required":false,"description":"设置TextInput控制器。","enum":null,"enumDescriptions":null,"default":null}}

类型名：TextInputController
类型描述：TextInput组件的控制器继承自TextContentControllerBase。
